    "final_answer": "## Task Complete: Trade-in Offers for the Latest iPhone\n\n**Yes, there are trade-in offers for the latest iPhone models on Apple's website.**\n\nI checked the official Apple Trade In page at **apple.com/shop/trade-in** and found the following trade-in offers for the latest iPhone models:\n\n| Latest iPhone Model | Estimated Trade-in Value |\n|---|---|\n| **iPhone 17 Pro Max** | Up to **$885** |\n| **iPhone 17 Pro** | Up to **$785** |\n| **iPhone Air** | Up to **$585** |\n| **iPhone 17** | Up to **$585** |\n\n### Summary\n- The **iPhone 17 Pro Max** is the latest flagship iPhone model and offers the highest trade-in value of up to **$885**.\n- Apple also offers trade-in values for older models, from iPhone 16 series down to older generations, with values starting from **$35** for the oldest eligible devices.\n- Users can either **trade in online** via the website (Apple gives credit toward a new device via Apple Gift Card/e-gift card) or at an **Apple Store** in person.\n- There's also a free recycling option for devices that have no trade-in value.\n\nTrade-in values are estimates and vary based on the device's condition, model, and specifications.",
